<title>USA: Manufactured Home gets $60 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Manufactured Home gets $60 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities Inc said Friday it obtained a new five-year, $60 million unsecured bank term loan.</p>
<p>The loan bears interest at LIBOR plus 100 basis points, it added.</p>
<p>Proceeds were used to repay amounts outstanding under the company's $100 million line of credit.</p>
<p>MHC, a real estate investment trust, owns or has controlling interests in 71 communities in 19 states.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
